This repository interacts with or bundles the following open-source components:

1. llama.cpp and ggml (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp)
   - License: MIT License
   - Used by: C++ stream recorder sources and scheduler patches in
     `code/signal-trace/recorder/` and `records/development/2026-11-10-speed-review/`.

2. Plotly.js 4.1.1 (https://github.com/plotly/plotly.js)
   - License: MIT License (Copyright (c) 2012-2026 Plotly, Inc.)
   - Bundled inline in: `studies/04-round-2-overlap/runs/one-pair-landscape-and-traces/explorer.html`
     so the interactive figure opens offline without external network requests.

3. Babylon.js (https://github.com/BabylonJS/Babylon.js)
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Referenced in: `apps/decode-machine/package.json`.

4. Manrope Font Family (https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/manrope)
   - License: SIL Open Font License 1.1
   - License text included at: `apps/decode-machine/public/assets/Manrope-OFL.txt`.
